comment11.text=\r\n Slowly move the triangle vertically.\r\n @param distance the desired distance in pixels\r\n
comment12.params=newHeight newWidth
comment12.target=void changeSize(int, int)
comment12.text=\r\n Change the size to the new size\r\n @param newHeight the new height in pixels. newHeight must be >\=0.\r\n @param newWidht the new width in pixels. newWidht must be >\=0.\r\n
comment13.params=newColor
comment13.target=void changeColor(java.lang.String)
comment13.text=\r\n Change the color. \r\n @param color the new color. Valid colors are "red", "yellow", "blue", "green",\r\n "magenta" and "black".\r\n
comment14.target=void draw()
comment14.text=\r\n Draw the triangle with current specifications on screen.\r\n
comment15.target=void erase()
comment15.text=\r\n Erase the triangle on screen.\r\n
comment16.target=double area()
comment16.text=\r\n Return the approximate area of this triangle, based on its\r\n Return the area in square pixels\r\n
comment17.target=void equilateral()
comment17.text=\r\n Turn this triangle into an equilateral triangle of approximately\r\n the same area as it currently has\r\n
comment18.params=times
comment18.target=void walk(int)
comment18.text=\r\n Make the triangle "fall" while walking sideways\: on each step it\r\n moves a bit horizontally (right if times is positive, left if\r\n negative) and a bit downward, abs(times) times\r\n
comment19.params=color width height
comment19.target=Triangle(java.lang.String, int, int)
comment19.text=\r\n Create a new triangle with a given color, width and height,\r\n at the default position\r\n color -> the initial color\r\n width -> the initial width\r\n height -> the initial height\r\n
comment2.target=void makeVisible()
comment2.text=\r\n Make this triangle visible. If it was already visible, do nothing.\r\n
comment20.params=other
comment20.target=boolean isBigger(Triangle)
comment20.text=\r\n Check whether this triangle has a bigger area than another one.\r\n other -> the triangle to compare against\r\n Return true if this triangle's area is greater than other's\r\n
comment3.target=void makeInvisible()
comment3.text=\r\n Make this triangle invisible. If it was already invisible, do nothing.\r\n
